31,1,1,talk,Servas,,A new day brings new clarity. I hope we can reach a consensus peacefully.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minako,,I have information. Servas is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,George,,"That was a very sudden claim. Are you the Seer, Minako?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, if you are the Seer, that is a bold move to reveal yourself so early.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,What?! Servas is the wolf? But he's so nice!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, it is a tragedy that you would cast such a shadow upon me. I am merely a humble man.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minako,,I do not lie about the facts. My divination was clear.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,George,,It is possible the werewolf is claiming to be the Seer to frame an innocent person.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"That is a logical possibility. However, if Minako is a villager, she has no reason to lie.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Maybe it's a prank? No, this is a real game. I'm confused!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@George, I appreciate your caution. Truth is often obscured by confidence.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@George, @Asuka, if we do not act on this information now, the wolf will only kill more of us.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,George,,I am not yet convinced. We should consider if there is a Possessed player trying to stir trouble.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"If Minako is the Seer, the most efficient move is to execute Servas immediately.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I want to believe Servas, but Minako sounds so sure!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I accept whatever fate the village decides, for my conscience is clear.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minako,,The evidence is my vision. I urge you all to vote for Servas.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,George,,I will vote based on the weight of the arguments.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Asuka,,The risk of keeping a confirmed werewolf is higher than the risk of a fake Seer.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'll trust Minako this time! Sorry, Servas!","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
